# Blender sources are NOT in git: they run to hundreds of MB each and blow
# past GitHub's 100 MB hard limit. ART_PIPELINE.md §8 still requires sources
# to accompany contributed art -- when the pipeline goes live they belong in
# Git LFS, decimated and licence-checked first (§7). Keep them on disk or in
# asset storage until then.
art/src/*.blend
art/src/*.blend1
